vendor/trivy — third-party ruleset, ported

================================================================================
Third-party content
================================================================================

The two files in this directory — rules.js (the `builtinRules` data: rule
IDs, categories, titles, severities, regex patterns, keywords, path scopes,
and the jwt-token rule's nested allow-rule) and allow-rules.js (the
`builtinAllowRules` global path/content allow-list) — are ported from:

    Trivy (https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy)
    pkg/fanal/secret/builtin-rules.go
    pkg/fanal/secret/builtin-allow-rules.go
